Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.20,0:00:03.07,Caption,,0,0,0,,Energy gets wasted for a boring reason:
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.21,0:00:06.90,Caption,,0,0,0,,nobody trusts the forecast enough to act on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.20,0:00:09.08,Caption,,0,0,0,,In September 2026, I built Agentic Arbiter.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.22,0:00:11.90,Caption,,0,0,0,,It covers 238 real data-centre campuses across 36 US states.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.20,0:00:14.07,Caption,,0,0,0,,Data centres run chillers even when
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.21,0:00:16.40,Caption,,0,0,0,,the air outside is already cold enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.70,0:00:22.90,Caption,,0,0,0,,It works hour by hour, deciding when it's safe to shut the chillers off.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.20,0:00:25.73,Caption,,0,0,0,,It made no unsafe calls.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.87,0:00:28.40,Caption,,0,0,0,,The old controller made one.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.70,0:00:32.40,Caption,,0,0,0,,Over five real years, that's about four hundred extra hours a year.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.70,0:00:33.78,Caption,,0,0,0,,And it grades itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.92,0:00:37.68,Caption,,0,0,0,,Here it's missing its target, because the data was patchy during the hackathon window.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.82,0:00:38.90,Caption,,0,0,0,,It says so itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.20,0:00:42.75,Caption,,0,0,0,,Second of 842 teams, out of more than four thousand people,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.89,0:00:44.82,Caption,,0,0,0,,at FortyGuard's hackathon, sponsored by NVIDIA.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.96,0:00:46.90,Caption,,0,0,0,,The UN's Cool Coalition featured it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.20,0:00:50.90,Caption,,0,0,0,,Next I want it running live on real sites, not just measured on them.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.20,0:00:52.35,Caption,,0,0,0,,Then I looked at home.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.49,0:00:55.49,Caption,,0,0,0,,Pakistan has solar on millions of roofs, but the grid can't see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.63,0:00:58.40,Caption,,0,0,0,,Go over two hundred units a month, and every unit gets re-priced.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.70,0:00:59.66,Caption,,0,0,0,,I asked twenty-one families.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.80,0:01:03.40,Caption,,0,0,0,,Seven of the ten with solar are already trying to use more sun by day.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.70,0:01:05.55,Caption,,0,0,0,,So I'm building a Solar Home Agent.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.69,0:01:09.40,Caption,,0,0,0,,It reads tomorrow's weather, then picks when to run the motor and the iron.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.70,0:01:13.40,Caption,,0,0,0,,Same habit: it remembers how wrong it's been.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.70,0:01:16.48,Caption,,0,0,0,,Moving a few jobs into the afternoon keeps this home under the limit.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.62,0:01:17.90,Caption,,0,0,0,,About five thousand rupees this month.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.20,0:01:19.87,Caption,,0,0,0,,Nearly nineteen thousand over the next six.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.01,0:01:22.40,Caption,,0,0,0,,It's a simulation, on one real month of Islamabad weather.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.70,0:01:26.21,Caption,,0,0,0,,Thirteen said they'd only trust an app that explains itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.35,0:01:27.40,Caption,,0,0,0,,So mine does.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.70,0:01:30.92,Caption,,0,0,0,,When it isn't sure, it says no,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.06,0:01:32.90,Caption,,0,0,0,,and tells you why.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.20,0:01:35.90,Caption,,0,0,0,,It keeps score against what the sun actually did.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.20,0:01:38.97,Caption,,0,0,0,,But look what it can't fix: it still wastes most of its midday sun,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.11,0:01:39.90,Caption,,0,0,0,,and buys after dark.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.20,0:01:43.70,Caption,,0,0,0,,Storage closes that.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.00,0:01:47.40,Caption,,0,0,0,,Next: five to ten homes in Islamabad, over WhatsApp.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.54,0:01:51.70,Caption,,0,0,0,,Then add them into one neighbourhood forecast, with our distribution company.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.00,0:01:54.16,Caption,,0,0,0,,The solar is already on Pakistan's roofs.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.30,0:01:57.70,Caption,,0,0,0,,I want to help the grid see it, and trust it.
